    {
        "text": "The breeze in the mountains is ever crisp and cool."
    },
    {
        "text": "And mornings as refreshing as these are always fine for settling muddy, murky matters."
    },
    {
        "text": "In a mountain-sat village, when kitchen's smoke has just sprung up, the snow still unreceded in spring, one old and one young stand off against each other."
    },
    {
        "text": "The only sound, the single strike of a faraway gong."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You've kept me waiting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#8$1",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Tch. Bloody lout... Light, stay cool for the moment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've seen you before. Hmm. So it was you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unexpected, for sure. A Rim Billitonian, silently lurking in Shangshu since the very beginning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't understand you, sorry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Light!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What\u2014?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A snare?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "You train these slumberfoots well. An ordinary woman would be headfirst in the ground by now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(He didn't just notice the snare behind him, he stepped on the rope without hesitation... Bastard...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, I won't make this hard for you, girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know what that goblet you're holding is?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not my concern, or my interest. It's newbie bounty hunters that ask too many questions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then you have only yourself to blame.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't get so full of yourself! Helmet! Drill!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$normal02_intro",
        "key": "$normal02_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.4,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$fightgeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_punch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you don't know what it is, then be wise and hand it over. Don't be used for nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "H-How dare you do that to Helmet\u2014! You asked for it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.7,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.02,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_atk_arrow_h"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0.95,
        "g": 0.95,
        "b": 0.95,
        "fadetime": 0.25,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.6,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 8,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...A headless bolt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "(H-He caught it barehanded? At this distance?! And I *just* changed the string on my crossbow\u2014!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "Seeing how you're unwilling to take my life, I'll give you one chance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hand over the goblet to me, and then tell the one instructing you: Tread carefully. Don't be selfish.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. You know who hired me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether I know or not doesn't matter. What matters is I can stop you, right here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why should I listen to you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have no choice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe you can run, but you could never bear to see these beasts of yours meet a sorry fate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're threatening me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have skill. But aside from your crossbow, you've got nothing in a fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "You can pull out before you're in too deep. You need a good eye and the right people, if you want to survive here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "True. They never told me someone as capable as you would get in the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I had someone do something dangerous for me, I wouldn't give them the whole picture either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just a job to you, stranger. Why stake your life on it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give the cup to me, and I vow on the Escorts' name that whatever they're paying you, we'll double it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hah, I was taking a loss anyway with all my volunteer work.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Call this a favor for a friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "So even you bandits of the wild don't mind a sacrifice for a friend.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sounds like you've got something against us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... not at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "The longer you do business, the more fine people you meet, the less friends you end up with.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#11$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then be smart, and go back to your business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, business is always easiest done in the mountains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "Three Mounts, Seventeen Peaks, hundreds of passes. Is there any road without a teahouse and station for travelers to rest their feet? Is there any road... without our people?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope you see clear now, girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You really don't think anything of me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "text": "A direct confrontation might not be my style, but you've pissed me off just far enough... isn't that right, my darlings?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Rim Billitonian) The old todger wants to have a go, let's give 'im a go! We've been around the paddock a few times, we're no strangers!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some just refuse to learn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If that's your answer, then you'll pay the\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "rfrom": 0,
        "gfrom": 0,
