        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$swordtsing2",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 12,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if a third party was stood there watching, they wouldn't have a clue just how the coming step came to land."
    },
    {
        "text": "Simply put, the man is adept in walking passes, in climbing mountains. The steps he lifts and places, day after day after day, are truly too many to count."
    },
    {
        "text": "In one clean noise, clay bricks shatter in the ground. Before him, dust drifts down. By his gaze is a simple, common bamboo-wood carrying pole. His gaze itself, faint rage."
    },
    {
        "text": "Far away, the gong strikes again."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014H-How... Where did he come from... Wait, Light, calm down! And Drill! Back to me...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...It's you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "text": "You finally came to the mountains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "So I came to find you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "text": "What comes will come. Nothing's avoidable forever. Is there a need to be so hasty?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey. Miss.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Are you talking to me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "text": "(His movement\u2014is that wooden stick one of their carrying poles? What did he do just now... to shatter bricks made of stone?)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you know him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then there's some problem between you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I only see you between us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right. I'm your problem, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "When I'm done here, I'll come see you. But not now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss. Does this relate to the item in your hands?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh... it does...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is personal business. And major at that. Stay out of it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "How major?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The safety of the nation is at stake! Life and death!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since that rainy night those years ago, I've rarely heard you use such a tone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see. How could you be the villain here? What a chivalrous swordsman. What a dutiful innkeeper.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then get out of the way\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014But I know just who you are, and that's why you'll never see me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "And if you won't, then it changes nothing if I find you. That's why I never came down from the mountains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "So. If...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_punch",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey! You\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give that back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was ten years.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ten years ago, you watched as my son died... so you could protect this goblet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shang Zhong!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss. This is nothing to do with you now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You steal my things while I'm not looking, and then tell me it's not my business?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This was never yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shang Zhong, have you lost it?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're free to go now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shang Zhong!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Leave!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_476_blkngt_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grr...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mark my words, you two... I'll be back for it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Blacknight"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "middle",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 300,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Zheng Qingyue... Where's your blade?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "At home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see. At home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "That rainy night, in the escort, over a dozen lost their lives. There was a boy among them, and a father.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "The boy was a Shang. My boy. The father was a Du. Du Yaoye's father.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why you don't carry your blade.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a tremendous joke.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You still hate me to this day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't hate you. I know you didn't mean to. The blame lies with you, but no fault.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Save the goods, then the men,' hm?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yet the goods are gone now, and so are the men. Am I still not allowed to condemn you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "I must ask you give justification, or else I cannot live on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_300_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I will. Give me the goblet. Do you know what it entails\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Innkeeper Zheng"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No. He died for this cup then. I'll bury it beside him today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll be waiting atop the mountain, for you to fetch your blade.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pole-Carrier"
    },
    {
