    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're back, Uncle?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "How were things?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In regards to her, thoughtful of etiquette, true as can be.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If she was so ready to display etiquette, that shows there's still room for mediation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is regardless of how she acts, or what intentions she harbors. Master Tai's instructions lie here, and they can't be false.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She's clever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since I visited in an official's capacity, she should have realized to some extent.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#5$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Both sides are now strained to breaking point. We stand on a hair trigger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We can only resolve this incident before we draw even more dispute.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Taihe"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If we really do want everyone to trust that our methods can forever rid Yan of the sword hanging over her head, then we naturally must obey those magic words\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_297_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_299_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Frank and forthright.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
